---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-24 border-t border-white/[0.06] py-10">
  <div class="container-page grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] sm:items-start">
    <div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" class="h-8 w-8" aria-hidden="true">
          <rect x="1" y="1" width="30" height="30" rx="9" fill="#232930" stroke="rgba(244,240,228,0.14)"></rect>
          <path d="M9 11h14M9 21h14M11 9v14M21 9v14" stroke="rgba(244,240,228,0.14)" stroke-width="1"></path>
          <circle cx="9" cy="11" r="2.7" fill="#6c9fe8"></circle>
          <circle cx="23" cy="11" r="2.7" fill="#6cc28c"></circle>
          <circle cx="9" cy="21" r="2.7" fill="#e57a70"></circle>
          <circle cx="23" cy="21" r="2.7" fill="#f4f0e4"></circle>
        </svg>
        <div>
          <p class="font-display text-sm font-semibold text-bone-100">Calculadora IP — CIDR y VLSM</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-meteor-500">Proyecto 2 · Redes de Computadoras</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-meteor-400">
        Herramienta académica de la Escuela Superior de Cómputo (IPN). Todos los
        cálculos se ejecutan en tu navegador: no se envía ninguna dirección a un
        servidor.
      </p>
    </div>

    <nav aria-label="Enlaces del pie" class="grid gap-2 text-sm">
      <a href="/cidr/" class="text-meteor-300 transition hover:text-bone-50">Calculadora CIDR</a>
      <a href="/vlsm/" class="text-meteor-300 transition hover:text-bone-50">Calculadora VLSM</a>
      <a href="/guia/" class="text-meteor-300 transition hover:text-bone-50">Guía y casos de prueba</a>
      <a href="/guia/#algoritmo" class="text-meteor-300 transition hover:text-bone-50">Algoritmo VLSM</a>
    </nav>
  </div>

  <div class="container-page mt-8 flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-white/[0.06] pt-6 text-xs text-meteor-500 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
    <p>ESCOM · Instituto Politécnico Nacional · {year}</p>
    <p>Astro + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS</p>
  </div>
</footer>
